  "reaction_group_note": "W1-07 round 4. The group is the FACTION the person belongs to read as a social body, except where the person's own trade reads differently: a rootkeeper of the Xul-Aneekh is RG-ROOT (a well-keeper, wherever they draw their pay) rather than RG-DEEP, and the intake keepers of the gallery are RG-DEEP because the gallery is the interior's own. The Drowned Court maps to RG-COURT, the one all-zero row in the 12x10 matrix — which is why ten of the thirty-two main-quest stages are race-blind by authorship rather than by exemption."
}
